[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0010","text":"爱依，辛苦了\n很棒的握手会哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0020","text":"对吧～\n那个孩子好像没受伤，太好了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0030","text":"是啊。包括应对突发状况在内\n做得很出色"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0040","text":"多亏了之前一起练习嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0050","text":"──所以，给"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0060","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0070","text":"握手♪\n对制作人的感谢之情～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0080","text":"哈哈，原来如此\n那这样的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0090","text":"谢啦\n制作人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900900_03_0100","text":"嗯，我才要谢谢你\n一直这么努力，爱依"}]
